@startuml pub-c4-context
' C4 Level 1 — System Context — Publication (PUB) context of Cordelê
title Cordelê — Publication (PUB) — System Context

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #24608A
}

actor "Coordenador(a) Editorial\n(Marina — Editora Aetós)" as Editor

rectangle "Cordelê Platform\n(modular monolith)" as Monolith {
  rectangle "Publication (PUB)\nbounded context" as PUB #E8F0FE
  rectangle "Import (IMP)\ncontext" as IMP
  rectangle "Composition (COMP)\ncontext" as COMP
  rectangle "Projects (PROJ)\ncontext" as PROJ
}

rectangle "Angular Frontend\n(cordele-web)" as FE
rectangle "BFF (NestJS)\nsingle entry point" as BFF
database "PostgreSQL 16\nschema-per-tenant\n(cordele_global + emp_<slug>)" as PG
rectangle "File Storage\n(local disk POC / S3 prod)" as Storage
rectangle "epubcheck\n(W3C ePub validator, Java CLI/JAR)" as EpubCheck

Editor --> FE : Gerar ePub (T07)\ndownload / histórico (T08)
FE --> BFF : HTTPS (OAuth2 JWT)
BFF --> PUB : POST /api/pub/.../publicacoes (202)\nGET .../status (poll), .../download
PUB --> IMP : in-process read\n(ManuscriptContentPort)
PUB --> COMP : in-process read\n(GetMetadados / GetConfiguracaoLayout)
PUB --> PROJ : in-process call\n(advanceTo publicado|com_erros)
PUB ..> EpubCheck : validate .epub\n(child process — authoritative verdict)
PUB --> PG : persist Publicacao + validation_message\n(tenant schema)
PUB --> Storage : store .epub / sign download URL\n(tenant-scoped keys)
PROJ ..> PUB : PublicationHistoryPort / PublicationErasurePort\n(in-process)

note bottom of PUB
  No broker, no TechLab AI, no hub.
  Async in-process build (gerando->validando->publicado|com_erros);
  progress via bounded polling (no SSE). epubcheck is authoritative.
  Never ships an artifact epubcheck has not accepted.
end note
@enduml
